, so I came to ask Hinatakuho-san to draw it for me.\nI would like to ask you to draw an original character of me and my friend in a TRPG. Our relationship is that of childhood friends, a boy who is careless about fashion and a girl who is eccentric about fashion, so I'd love to have you draw casual and cute clothes for the two of us... The difference in height between the two is 170cm and 140cm, and we'd like to use them as standby screens for our mobile phones, so we'd be happy if they were long and tall. It will be a lot of work for you to come up with the outfits, but we appreciate your consideration.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/m13op4ct3dgtp8l/AABnW5ij1VmjAzHgw83pX13Ra?dl=0", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 562100, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "やもり8cm🌱Vtuber", "screen_name": "space___8", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1924780065612840960/ipBZHNaz.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1223111997526405120/1711976442/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 969481, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "うめ", "screen_name": "ume_spla4", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1904826128998817794/XCmEJ7vw.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1021018003175948295/1645144430/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 40, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction